WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
<v Maya>Security review status check. Devin, where are we?

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
<v Devin>The security review passed. The data residency risk is now closed.

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Priya>Great. But I disagree with the March launch, I think April is safer.

4
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:27.000
<v Maya>We decided to go with an April launch date instead of March.

5
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:34.000
<v Devin>I'll update the rollout plan to reflect April by 2026-02-09.

6
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:40.000
<v Priya>The launch still depends on the multi-language support being ready.
